  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the binchotan grill to medium heat.",
    "Thread the diced melons, chopped fresh mint leaves, and edible flowers onto skewers.",
    "Drizzle the binchotan grill oil over the skewers.",
    "Sprinkle the dried lemon myrtle and chopped macadamia nuts over the skewers.",
    "Place the skewers on the preheated grill and cook for 2-3 minutes per side.",
    "Steam the skewers using a mushimono steam method for an additional 2 minutes.",
    "Serve the melon skewers warm, garnished with additional fresh mint leaves and edible flowers if desired.",
    "Repeat the cooking process for the remaining skewers."
  ],
